export anchor DarkConcreteStyle:
    number: 258
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark concrete
    idea: A brutalist editor cast in raw dark concrete slabs with deep seams, form tie holes and spray stencilled labels, where safety yellow marks the active tool, the selection and the one action that matters.
    base: dark
    palette:
        seam: #111213, the page and the 8px gaps between slabs
        slab: #2a2b2c, header, layers, inspector, status and the style sheet with a faint noise grain
        cast: #232425, the canvas well and the zoom block
        aggregate: #3a3b3d, avatar squares
        pit: #18191a, recessed fields and layer tiles
        ink: #e6e4df, text and outlines
        dust: #a9a7a1, meta and field captions
        safetyYellow: #f2c230, the active tool, the selected tile, Share, handles, focus and hazard tape
        safetyOrange: #c24e00, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        Three stacks. Labels and figures use Stencil Std, Impact,
        Haettenschweiler, Arial Narrow Bold in caps tracked 0.06 to 0.14em.
        Text uses Helvetica Neue, Arial, system-ui. Captions and status use
        ui-monospace. The file name is 24px stencil, panel titles 22px,
        inspector values 26px stencil, layer names 14px 700, status 13px mono
        caps and captions 11 to 12px mono.
    layout:
        Everything is a concrete slab separated by 8px dark seams, and big
        slabs carry two form tie holes at the top corners. The header slab
        holds a yellow BW block, CANVAS / WEBSITE REDESIGN over HOME V3,
        square outlined avatars, an outlined Present and a yellow Share. A
        full width row of seven blocks follows, the six tools as 64px slabs
        with icon, stencil name and key letter, Move solid yellow, and a 66%
        zoom block. Below sit two columns, the wide left and a 340px
        inspector. The left holds the canvas well with a faint 48px grid and
        the white Hero frame outlined 3px in yellow with square yellow
        handles, and under it the layers as a grid of 150px tiles, each with a
        number and kind, a kind icon, the name and note, the Hero tile solid
        yellow with Selected and the Features tile with Collapsed. The
        inspector stacks blocks with yellow stencil headings and sunk fields
        holding 26px figures, X 0, W 1440, #FFFFFF, Gap 32, Padding 96, R 0,
        PNG and 2x, then an outlined Export Hero. The status slab has a yellow
        and black hazard tape top edge and mono caps items. Below 860px slabs
        stack with the canvas first and the tool row becomes a sticky bottom
        row.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 8px seams between slabs, 24px slab padding, 8px between tiles and fields.
    density: Chunky. 64px tool blocks, 104px layer tiles and 26px figures.
    corners: None. Every slab, tile, field and button is square.
    borders: Seams instead of borders, 2px ink outlines on secondary buttons and avatars, a hazard stripe tape over the status slab.
    shadows: Inset shadows sink fields and tie holes. Slabs are flat with a noise grain.
    icons:
        Line icons at 2.4px stroke with square ends, 20px. Selected is a
        circled check, Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a cloud with a check,
        always with the word.
    focus: A 4px solid safety yellow outline, ink on yellow fills.
    tone: Site signage in stencil caps such as POSITION / SIZE, EXPORT HERO and SAVED 2 MINUTES AGO.
